RUNTIME DEPENDENCIES — NOT REDISTRIBUTED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following are provided by the Morpheus appliance at runtime and are NOT
bundled in this JAR. They are listed for completeness only.

  - Morpheus Plugin API (Morpheus Data)
  - Apache Groovy
  - RxJava
  - SLF4J

The plugin also invokes the following on managed hypervisors, where host
telemetry is enabled. These are system-installed, are never redistributed, and
are only ever read from:

  - libvirt (virsh)          — LGPL-2.1-or-later
  - Open vSwitch (ovs-appctl) — Apache-2.0
  - multipath-tools           — GPL-2.0
  - open-iscsi (iscsiadm)     — GPL-2.0
